  "description": "Discover your new home at Marshall Yards, Dublin's newest prime residential location in the heart of the Dublin Docklands.\r\n\r\n\r\n *FREE High Speed Wifi Included*\r\n\r\n\r\nExperience the ease and convenience of city-centre living at Marshall Yards, with stylish rental apartments, resident's gym, pickle ball court, co working spaces, resident's lounge, rooftop terraces, outdoor BBQ area and 24 hour concierge/ security.  \r\nThen easily step outside to enjoy the vibrant cafes, shops and cultural spots of Dublin's historic Docklands.\r\n\r\n\r\nMarshall Yards offers a range of apartment sizes and styles from Studio, 1 Bedroom, 2 Bedroom and 3 Bedrooms.  Each apartment features high-quality finishes, energy efficient appliances and spacious layouts.  Our curated selection of branded furniture showcases exceptional craftmanship, ensuring residents enjoy both comfort and style. \r\n\r\n\r\nApartment features:\r\n\r\n-\tComplimentary Fast Fibre Broadband\r\n-\tFully Furnished with Contemporary Designed Interiors\r\n-\tPremium Integrated Kitchen\r\n-\tPrivate Balcony\r\n-\tPremium Finishes\r\n-\tSmart Heating System\r\n-\tClever storage solutions\r\n-\tCity, Sea, or Mountain Views\r\n-\tEnergy-Efficient\r\n-\tPet-Friendly\r\n\r\n\r\nAt Marshall Yards, we're proud to be a top certified sustainable development which is proof of our deep commitment to the planet and your well-being.  Marshall Yards efficient design and smart building technologies helps to reduce your carbon footprint while lowering utility costs, so you can live sustainably without compromising on comfort or affordability.\r\n\r\n\r\nMarshall Yards amenities go beyond convenience, offering a fully considered living experience that feels seamless and effortless. \r\n\r\nResident Amenities:\r\n\r\n-\tFREE High Speed WiFi Throughout the Development\r\n-\tMY Gym - Fitted with Premium TechnoGym Equipment\r\n-\tCo Working Space with Bookable Meeting Rooms\r\n-\tResident's Lounge\r\n-\tMY Cafe\r\n-\tConcierge\r\n-\tMYLiving Resident App\r\n-\tTulu\r\n-\tParcel Lockers\r\n-\tCar Club\r\n-\tElectric Scooters\r\n-\tElectric Car Charging Points\r\n-\tMy Comfort+\r\n-\tCommunity Events\r\n-\tBookable Private Kitchen\r\n-\tOutdoor BBQ Area\r\n-\tPickleball Courts\r\n-\tRooftop Terraces\r\n\r\n\r\nFrom your home to the wider community, every detail crafted to enhance your lifestyle and ensure you feel completely at home, every day.\r\n\r\nVisit www.marshallyards.com for more details and to schedule a guided tour or a virtual viewing.\r\n\r\n\r\nMake Marshall Yards Your New Home Today!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note:\r\n \r\nThere are multiple property types available in this development. The photos shown here may not be of the actual unit available but represent the standard of finish. \r\n\r\nThe rent advertised on the individual property ads represent the starting rent for these property types. Rents will vary throughout the development depending on the specific property type.",
